 =?UTF-8?q?=20FLAC=20onto=20a=20cached=20YouTube=20prefix,=20probe=20the?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20first=20missing=20byte,=20allow=20smooth=20swaps=20after=20a?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20blend,=20refused=20pins=20stay=20refused,=203-part=20version?=
